286
00:12:11,470 --> 00:12:13,870
Seedance 2.0 180,

287
00:12:13,890 --> 00:12:16,910
Grok 180, FLUX 3 240,

288
00:12:16,930 --> 00:12:19,330
Seedance 2.5 280이었습니다.

289
00:12:19,350 --> 00:12:21,863
가장 싼 MiniMax는

290
00:12:21,883 --> 00:12:23,720
